      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
        <p>句级语义水印是否普遍依赖分割单元化（unitization）？重分句威胁能否被科学地评估？</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="222" width="44" height="26">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="16" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(76,122,90,1)" textAlign="left" wrap="false">
        <p>02</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="112" topLeftY="222" width="788" height="26">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)" textAlign="left">
        <p><span bold="true">做了什么 · 怎么做</span></p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="112" topLeftY="252" width="788" height="40">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="14" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(77,90,83,1)" textAlign="left" lineSpacing="multiple:1.4">
        <p>系统检索邻近工作并逐项核对覆盖：AliMark 已把 sentence split/merge 与重构对齐列为核心问题；SwordStamp 已覆盖 rewording / reordering / resegmentation 与子句级检测。</p>
      </content>
    </shape>

    <shape type="text" topLeftX="60" topLeftY="304" width="44" height="26">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="16" fontFamily="Inter" color="rgba(76,122,90,1)" textAlign="left" wrap="false">
        <p>03</p>
      </content>
    </shape>
    <shape type="text" topLeftX="112" topLeftY="304" width="788" height="26">
      <content textType="body" fontSize="15" fontFamily="思源宋体" color="rgba(42,45,48,1)" textAlign="left">
